Package: easyNIS
Title: Tidy Workflows for the National Inpatient Sample
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Muhammad", "Saad", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "msaadasif.md@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1792-2357")),
    person("Ali", role = "aut"))
Description: Pipe-friendly tools for opening annual Healthcare Cost and
    Utilization Project National Inpatient Sample Parquet files, flagging
    diagnosis and procedure codes, looking up user-supplied CCSR codes, adding
    experimental Elixhauser indicators, preparing designs and weights with the
    'survey' package,
    applying supported HCUP labels, adjusting charges and costs, and reviewing
    disclosure risks. Experimental methods and annual-layout assumptions are
    not independently verified or scientifically approved.
